This licence covers the pipeline, the web application and the documentation in
this repository — the code that reads the book and presents it.

It does not cover the book. Elmer D. Merrill's *A Dictionary of the Plant Names
of the Philippine Islands* (Bureau of Government Laboratories, Department of the
Interior, Manila, 1903, Publication No. 8) is in the public domain, as is the
scan of it distributed by the Internet Archive as `dictionaryofplan00merr`.
Nothing here places any restriction on either.

The transcriptions in `data/corrections/` are readings of a public-domain text
and are offered on the same terms as the text itself: use them freely. Please
keep the attribution to Merrill and the Bureau of Government Laboratories on
any derivative, not because this licence requires it, but because the work is
his.
